          ],
          "text": "According to Andrew J. Pincus (Petitioner), according to Andrew J. Pincus (Petitioner), they argue that the FAA requires arbitration agreements to be valid, irrevocable, and enforceable, and that any limitation must be grounded in recognized legal or equitable grounds for contract revocation."
